flowchart TD
    A[Player selects difficulty] --> B[Secret number generated\nrandom.randint low, high]
    B --> C[Player enters a guess]
    C --> D[parse_guess\nvalidates input]
    D -->|invalid| E[Show error message]
    D -->|valid| F[check_guess\ncompares guess to secret]
    F --> G[get_temperature_emoji\nadds hot/cold hint]
    F --> H[update_score\nadjusts score]
    G --> I[Hint shown to player]
    H --> I
    F -->|Win or out of attempts| J[Game ends]
    J --> K[coach_feedback\nreviews full guess history]
    K --> L[Strategy feedback shown to player]
    I --> C